        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The Quill agent watches your docs repository and syncs changes to Quill. This page covers installing the agent with a package manager, configuring it, and connecting it to Quill Cloud or a self-managed server. If you only want to try Quill, see ",
          "span": [199, 452]
